  "question": {
    "text": "Two trains, which are moving along different tracks in opposite directions towards each other, are put on the same track due to a mistake. Their drivers, on noticing the mistake, start slowing down the trains when the trains are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> apart. Graphs given below show their velocities as a function of time as the trains slow down. What is the separation between the trains (in metre) when both have stopped?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032422_Ques_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 217px; height: 112px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032422_Ques_2.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 215px; height: 112px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Using the concept that the area under the v-t graph gives the change in displacement.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br />Relative displacement<br /><br /><math><mrow> <msub> <mtext>s</mtext> <mtext>relative</mtext> </msub> </mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>280</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>280</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
